# xshow: the X11 screen front end (t_xwin.c) was never part of this
# source tree; the command explains that instead of silently doing
# nothing.  This pins the refusal.  xconh, xreg and xplotf are the
# same class (they need a live plot window) but TDA halts a command
# file at the first error, so only the first can be pinned here.
xshow;
